{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hey Audrey, had a great weekend! My girlfriend and I went on a bike ride and stumbled upon a cool park outside of town. It was awesome to get away from the city and be surrounded by nature."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-5d260b9ab06f94e6f0ca0eb0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.178376+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d260b9ab06f94e6f0ca0eb0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d260b9ab06f94e6f0ca0eb0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's cool! I love checking out new parks with my four pups. Last weekend was so fun - our dogs were able to run around and get some fresh air. On top of that, I recently joined a dog owners group to learn how to better take care of them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-df0b31da074e0200636729b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.217415+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "df0b31da074e0200636729b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "df0b31da074e0200636729b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: That sounds great! Your four pups must have a lot of fun. How often do you hang out with the dog owners group?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-214446d981a202407fe17b10", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.241035+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "214446d981a202407fe17b10", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "214446d981a202407fe17b10", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah, they're having a lot of fun. I try to meet up with other dog owners once a week for tips from other parents and so they can all play together. How about you? Have you ever thought about joining one?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-98303bec20a1455b6d26aa97", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.257616+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98303bec20a1455b6d26aa97", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98303bec20a1455b6d26aa97", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: That looks fun! Seeing those adorable pups made me think about getting another dog, but I'm still not sure. Having two dogs is already a lot to take care of. Do you have any tips on being a multi-dog pet owner?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-7119af70133883bb16f42ba3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.278209+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7119af70133883bb16f42ba3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7119af70133883bb16f42ba3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Maybe you want to take care of Toby and Buddy first. Having them happy and healthy would be a good first step before going all in for more dogs."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-d6bd00f305b551f4aab8fa44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.302065+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6bd00f305b551f4aab8fa44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6bd00f305b551f4aab8fa44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks, I think that's what I need to hear. I'll take good care of my dogs first."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-78c47f199d09d83277740e4a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.319537+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "78c47f199d09d83277740e4a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "78c47f199d09d83277740e4a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's great! Let me know if you need any help, I'm here for you! See how happy they are? You don't need more dogs to make them happy! :)"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-d40b9fad368069132c82d408", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.337642+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d40b9fad368069132c82d408", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d40b9fad368069132c82d408", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks Audrey! That's so nice of you. I think I've managed to make it work with dogs while still living in the city."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-f6d1450d16e6c5a0c53f598a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.348980+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6d1450d16e6c5a0c53f598a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6d1450d16e6c5a0c53f598a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah I feel you. Taking care of a pup in the city is tough but doable with the right approach. Keeping them active is key. Here's a pic of how I entertain them in my house with toys and games."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-e55134a37761e28c7ad13bdf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.375796+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e55134a37761e28c7ad13bdf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e55134a37761e28c7ad13bdf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, it's great to know there are ways to keep them active in the city. I'll keep that in mind. Thank you so much!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-03ff01e039274bb1f4380dd8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.398173+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "03ff01e039274bb1f4380dd8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "03ff01e039274bb1f4380dd8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: You got it! There are lots of ways to keep them happy in the city. Make sure to socialize and exercise them daily. Get creative and add some mental stimulation too. Here's a pic of them playing fetch in the park - they love it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-a490a10a0bef6f4d58622926", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.418546+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a490a10a0bef6f4d58622926", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a490a10a0bef6f4d58622926", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: That's so cute! What sort of activities do you do to stay mentally stimulated?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-f3645bc753d8da43ac72425b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.438457+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f3645bc753d8da43ac72425b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f3645bc753d8da43ac72425b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: We give them lots of activities to keep them busy - puzzles, training, hide-and-seek - they love it all!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-cc19ed7b12139566782be941", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.457380+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cc19ed7b12139566782be941", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cc19ed7b12139566782be941", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Cool ideas! I think I'll give those activities a try with my pups. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-981ca37a169402e7f8806775", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.476608+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "981ca37a169402e7f8806775", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "981ca37a169402e7f8806775", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: No problem, glad I could help. Let me know how it goes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-f6eadf18f832d97f8987ef81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.493236+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6eadf18f832d97f8987ef81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6eadf18f832d97f8987ef81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Your advice and support really mean a lot to me! Thank you so much!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-a59d328652f6d8d0ca679af5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.510827+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a59d328652f6d8d0ca679af5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a59d328652f6d8d0ca679af5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's what friends are for - supporting each other. Your friendship means a lot to me. :)"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_27-7e89e0de48ec6b65af177fea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:38:19.523960+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7e89e0de48ec6b65af177fea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7e89e0de48ec6b65af177fea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
